ast weighing hundreds of kilos charging toward you. Who will win?</p>", "short_description": "Toro 2 is a 3D bullfighting simulator where you'll experience the thrill of bullfighting in the world's most famous bullrings in Career Mode. Challenge your friends in fast-paced Versus Mode, where you can choose between the raw power of a fighting bull or the skill and style of a bullfighter.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782390/6cccbc222e2f1d9edb6908c63c575314a02c255f/header.jpg?t=1788272599", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782390/c98ef160927c46630042f3ac222a66dc3a4e4b0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788272599", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782390/c98ef160927c46630042f3ac222a66dc3a4e4b0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788272599", "website": "https://recotech.es/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950, Radeon R7 360, or Intel HD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core 2.4ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060, Radeon RX 5600 XT, or Intel Arc A580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong>